{"version":1,"content":"<p>國際科研團隊近日開發出一種監測冰川內部變化的新方法。研究人員發現，一根普通光纖電纜即可充當高靈敏度傳感器，幫助科學家探測冰川深處肉眼無法觀察到的裂縫和結構變化，為理解冰川穩定性和預測未來海平面變化提供了重要工具。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586882.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:26:51.191622+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:01:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:10.289037+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:10.289037+00:00","content_hash":"b540d7c56423c727365f3717e1b3fdf3df2e4510872279fdb6d9396da243050a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}